// "Advantage on saves vs magic, halved/negated magical effects" for
// nearby allies -- a lingering group ward, same `StaticAura`+
// `ProtectingWard` shape as any of this school's other zone spells,
// group-targeted (`OutOfGroup` is used for hostile zones elsewhere in this
// pass; allies here, so `targets` stays the aura's own default caster-
// group reach via `InGroup`-equivalent aura placement). Sheet's save-
// advantage rider dropped -- no advantage/disadvantage-on-save mechanic
// exists (this engine has no roll-based save system at all outside
// `CasterLevelRoll`, which gates whether a debuff lands, not a defender's
// own resistance roll).
StaticAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    energy_cost: 100.0,
    targets: InGroup,
    auras: [
        (kind: ProtectingWard, strength: 0.3, duration: Some(60), category: Some(Magical)),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(60.0),
    range: 9.0,
    sprite_info: None,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Abjuration),
        source: Some(Divine),
        // level 5 spell -> min_level 30, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(30)),
    ),
)
